1074+ 83B6 30 0E            jr   nc, .shift_dx_gt_8        ; DeltaX in [9..15]
1075+ 83B8
1076+ 83B8                  ; DeltaX in [0..8]: shift a sinistra a 16 bit (D, E) per DeltaX volte
